t takes any actions. When the creature reaches 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", it is swallowed by the Krayt Dragon and continues to take 1d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acid"}," damage each round at the start of its turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Krayt Dragon cannot make Bite attacks until it releases the creature (a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},") or swallows it.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Tremorsense:"]}," A Krayt Dragon automatically senses the location of anything that is in contact with the ground within 100 squares (no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check required).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
